00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:34.740
The new experiments closed that chapter by carefully controlling conditions and measuring

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:39.940
surface fluctuations at high resolution. Researchers showed that the equations predictions hold up

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:45.300
across scales and materials. This cements its status as a fundamental framework, strengthening its

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:50.160
relevance not just in theoretical physics, but in biology, material science, and even engineering.

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:55.500
The validation gives scientists greater confidence to apply the KPZ framework to phenomena

00:09:55.500 --> 00:10:00.800
as diverse as tumor growth, thin film manufacturing, and the spread of bacterial biofilms.

